    "created_at": "2026-01-21T11:45:24Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-21T11:45:24Z",
    "body": "> It would improve ergonomics for TypeScript developers for WebIDL to define the chunk type for such streams.\n\n(I think this is independent from Web IDL and is already solved by @MattiasBuelens's series of patches in TS lib, although yes it would be useful if the IDL type was also generic as more automation can be involved.)",
